#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:1
#: 7dfbfe97ec1e4a6a88fc83b21e1999d9
msgid "Operations and contribution"
msgstr "Operacion y contribucion"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:3
#: 424aa09298844d9d945f4dd5a2f3baf5
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuracion"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:5
#: 78d8ff93cb8e4defa5233baec3585193
msgid ""
"Keep secrets outside documentation and source control. Use `.env.example` as"
" the public contract and store real values only in the designated local "
"settings surface."
msgstr ""
"Mantenga los secretos fuera de la documentacion y del control de codigo. Use"
" `.env.example` como contrato publico y guarde los valores reales solo en la"
" superficie local designada."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:7
#: 46faf3040cc84636bbf86de99d208a95
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "Pruebas"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:9
#: 221e584451f3419db010755c9ce456f3
msgid ""
"Run the repository checks listed in the quickstart. A passing narrow test "
"does not prove unrelated interfaces or scientific claims."
msgstr ""
"Ejecute las comprobaciones del repositorio indicadas en el inicio rapido. "
"Una prueba acotada superada no demuestra interfaces no relacionadas ni "
"afirmaciones cientificas."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:11
#: e405fc9714b547be98047f315759773f
msgid ""
"Run the suite auth audit before presenting the adapter fleet as "
"synchronized. A green audit means the policy files agree and forbidden "
"material was not admitted; it is not a substitute for browser login testing "
"in each application."
msgstr ""
"Run the suite auth audit before presenting the adapter fleet as "
"synchronized. A green audit means the policy files agree and forbidden "
"material was not admitted; it is not a substitute for browser login testing "
"in each application."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:13
#: d351f9edcba9436a95ded741bc80e73e
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solucion de problemas"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:15
#: be19c528c2bc457baaeee1606c5cf0ff
msgid "Confirm the repository and branch."
msgstr "Confirme el repositorio y la rama."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:16
#: d30ff456b678460aadad82dc43cf751f
msgid "Reproduce with the smallest supported input."
msgstr "Reproduzca con la entrada compatible mas pequena."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:17
#: 65c79a8caa2b410a9ca25cc2e38ceee6
msgid "Capture the exact command and error."
msgstr "Registre el comando y el error exactos."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:18
#: c5bb23c44bc54b479030730aa720469b
msgid "Check the documented runtime and lockfile."
msgstr "Compruebe el runtime documentado y el archivo de bloqueo."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:19
#: 6edab2b204764ca69ce7ae99a1181333
msgid "Open an issue with secret-free evidence."
msgstr "Abra una incidencia con evidencia sin secretos."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:21
#: a7dfac62130c435da1eabd1bd4df305e
msgid "Security and privacy"
msgstr "Seguridad y privacidad"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:23
#: a0c95c8730d5407190c68ce7b710b006
msgid ""
"The gateway transports and validates requests; it does not convert model "
"output into scientific authority."
msgstr ""
"La pasarela transporta y valida solicitudes; no convierte la salida de un "
"modelo en autoridad cientifica."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:25
#: 82b8e806ca884218a39791f293a2aa62
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Contribuir"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:27
#: 1df79417c6eb4352b06b577f9fce989a
msgid ""
"Read `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md`, and the repository "
"license when present. Keep changes bounded and include the checks that "
"justify acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Lea `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md` y la licencia del "
"repositorio cuando existan. Mantenga los cambios acotados e incluya las "
"comprobaciones que justifican su aceptacion."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:29
#: d0569c866c7941108dd8edc37e37b0e4
msgid "Releases"
msgstr "Versiones publicadas"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/operations.md:31
#: 2acb15bdcdcd41c6af0708fd40b98d67
msgid ""
"The current public documentation describes `0.1.0` with status `local-api`. "
"Consult the repository history and release notes for changes."
msgstr ""
"La documentacion publica actual describe `0.1.0` con el estado `local-api`. "
"Consulte el historial del repositorio y las notas de version para conocer "
"los cambios."
